  "ALL_TEXT": "44 INT. PUB-BAR TABLE - NIGHT\nVEDA is sitting at the bar counter, holding a glass of beer.\nThere are empty bottles lying next to the PUG. The PUG puts\nhis paw into the glass and licks it, lies down again and\nbarks.\nVEDA\nChaalivaaltiki... naa kanna ekkuva\nthaagava?\nThe PUG barks again\nVEDA\nNormuye. Beer bottleantha levu.\nPosthe peepa lepesettattunnaavu...\nThe PUG looks at him with his big brown eyes and then turns\nhis head away.\nVEDA\nabbo....alaaka, neeku thindi\npettadame ekkuva. Mandhu kuda\nadiginantha poyaalaa..dishti\npettakunda gammuna paduko.\nVEDA leans and whispers in the PUG\u2019s ear\nVEDA\nArdham chesukove........naa\ndhaggarinka dabbulu levu. Unnaa ee\nkaastha neeke posthe ela cheppu.\nNeni konchem thaagesthanu.\nChakkagaa intikelli podaam.\nThe PUG barks at him and moves a few feet away and lies on\nthe bar counter.\nVEDA\nChee...... nuvvu kukka jaathike\nkalamkame, assalu vishvaasam\nledu...Idhigo thaagu\nSULOCHANA who has been watching of all of this, comes\ncharging at VEDA.\nSULOCHANA\nManishiva pasuvvaa?.. Evadanna\nkukkapilla ki mandhu posthaara??..\nAdi antha glassa... chasthe?\nVEDA looks at her wondering why she is bothered. They\nsuddenly see each other properly.\nVEDA\nNuvva???\nNuvva???\nSULOCHANA\nVEDA\nNuvvu ikkadem\nchesthunnaavu...pubulki veladdam\nmee inta vanta ledhu annavu?\nSULOCHANA\nPanee medha vochanu ikadaki...nenu\njournalist kadha...\nVEDA\nOhhh page 3 journalist\naa...haha...edho crime reporter\nlaga posukotaavu aroju.\nSULOCHANA\nNaa sangathi pakanapetu...Thagadam\nallavatuledhu annavu....ipudu nuvu\nthagadamay kaakunda ee noruleni\njeevini kudaa thagisthunnaavu...\nVEDA\nHello..matter telusukuni maatlaadu\nnenu vaddhannaa..ade vinakunda\nthaaguthundi..aina neeku naaku enti\nsambhandam urlovaalla sangathulu\nneekendukamma? Nee drink aedo nuvvu\ntheesukuni sammaga enjoy cheyi\npo...\nSULOCHANA\nNeeku aelaaga job udindhi kadaa,\nnuvvu dheenini chusukolevu\nVEDA\nPelli cancel chesi mali vochi pundu\nmeedha karam jallaala?\nSULOCHANA\nSare kukka ni naaku ichey\nVEDA\nNenu enduku istha...job vochey\nvaruku idhe naaku thindi\npedthundhi.\nVEDA regrets blurting that out.\nSULOCHANA\nEnti?\nEmledhu.\nVEDA\nSULOCHANA\nSare enthakammuthav...\nVEDA\nAntey.. Nuvvu konttaavaa??\nSULOCHANA\nYes.\nVEDA\nAsalu maata meedha neelabadaleni\nfamily lo ki ee cute puppy ne\nammanu...\nSULOCHANA\nBha asalu daniki diniki emana\nsambhandam undha? Please neeku\nelago edhi bhaaram, ninna navala\nelantidhe maa pakainti kukka\npaaripoyindhi. vaala ki ee kukka ni\nreplacement kindha isthey\nsantoshitharu.\nFor a split second there is a wicked look on his face.\nVEDA\n(innocently)\nNalabai\nSULOCHANA\nWhat?? muppai kante ekkuva ivvanu.\nThe PUG barks. VEDA smirks.\nVEDA\nnee retu dhaanikkuda nachaledu.\nSarey final 35.\nSULOCHANA\nVEDA\nNalabhai ki konna nenu... aidhu\nthaggisthunna poni le ani...\nVaddante vadileyandi... daani\nkarmedo adi anubhavisthadi.\nSULOCHANA\nSarey numberistha repu kaluvu.\nVEDA\nNumber undhi le...nee laaga kaadhu\nneenu marchipodaaniki.\nSULOCHANA gives him a look and walks to the PUG, feeling\nsorry for him. She strokes its head.\nSULOCHANA\nJargindantlo na thappu emmi\nledhu...nanna chepindi chesa anthe.\nPerenti?\nVEDA looks up tries to get the conversation into a lighter\nvein.\nVEDA\nTerminator.\nThe PUG gets up and barks\nVEDA\nAbbo neekkuda nachchesindiraa..\nSULOCHANA\nAdhem peru!? Adhi kukka peru\nkaadhu.\nVEDA\n'Kukka perlu' ani specific gaa\nemanna untaaya???..\nDubbichintharvaatha nee\nishtamochina peru pettuko.\nSULOCHANA\nNeelaantodi chethilo idetla\npadindho asalu?\nShe takes her phone and walks away to her friends. The dog\nturns to look at him.\nVEDA\nEhi.. .repatnundi mandhu ledhu...\nakka perugannam, sorakaaya pedthadi\nthinu.\nCUT TO:",
